WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.787
Mixing light can't beat thermal.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.800
Two independent beams meet on a beam

3
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.801
splitter. How much entropy must come out?

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.626
Suppose some pair beat thermal light; comparing

5
00:00:11.626 --> 00:00:14.048
with thermal references forces a contradiction.

6
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.512
Claimed: never less than thermal light.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.359
Lean-checked main theorem.
